  "title": "Trial and condemnation of Galileo",
  "summary": "In 1633 the Inquisition in Rome judged Galileo vehemently suspected of heresy for holding that the Sun is the centre of the world. On 22 June 1633 the sentence banned his Dialogue by public edict, set formal prison at the tribunal's discretion, and required him to abjure. He was then kept under house arrest near Florence.",
